title: Antifaschistische Aktion
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: antifa_formed == 1 and antifa_timer = 0
on-arrival: antifa_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= Antifaschistische Aktion

Antifaschistische Aktion is our new antifascist coordination front, consisting of the SPD, the trade unions, and the Reichsbanner. How should we use the Iron Front?

[? if workers_spd < 45 or workers_spd < workers_nsdap or workers_spd < workers_kpd : Unfortunately, the Iron Front's effectiveness is dragged down by the SPD's unpopularity, as the SPD is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many Reichsbanner members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the fascists with the RFB.
- @cordinate: Establish local executive boards to coordinate interorganizational activities.
- @anti_fascism: Rally against fascism.
- @spd_collab: Work with the SPD and the socialist sections of the Reichsbanner.
- @antisemitism
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_strength += 15; rfb_militancy += 0.05; rfb_strength -= 10 if rfb_banned ==1; rfb_militancy -=0.2 if rfb_banned ==1

Antifaschistische Aktion rallies for joining the RFB and our self defense organizations.

[? if rfb_banned ==1 : Due to the banning of the RFB, it has a much harder time recruiting. ?]


@cordinate
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.02; rfb_strength += 10; workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); antifa_timer -=4

Our new commitees coordinate activity between Antifaschistische Aktion, the RFB, and the KPD itself.

@anti_fascism
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; workers_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent)

Antifaschistische Aktion, predictably, rallies against fascism and dictatorship.

@spd_collab
choose-if: united_front_maintained ==1 or spd_relation >= 60
unavailable-subtitle: We are unwilling to work with the SPD.
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); rural_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3; unemployed_spd += 3; new_middle_spd += 2; rural_spd += 1; reichsbanner_coordination += 1; spd_relation += 5

We increase collaboration with the SPD, which is far more accepted at the local level than with national leadership. Regardless, our rallies have more people and our proletarian unity impresses workers nonetheless.

@antisemitism
title: Rally against antisemitism and in defense of Jewish Germans.
view-if: confronting_antisemitism > 1
on-arrival: nationalism -= 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); confronting_antisemitism += 1; workers_nsdap -= 2.5*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 2.5*(1-dissent); workers_dnvp -= 2.5*(1-dissent); unemployed_dnvp -= 2.5*(1-dissent)

# TODO
The Nazis and other far-right political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the Jewish community of Germany, many of whom are our supporters. Antifaschistische Aktion rallies in defense of individual Jews and the broader community against antisemetic violence.
